                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is built around its "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "peanut sauce ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "peanut-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Everything else is just a vehicle for the sauce. The vegetables can be varied based on what you have. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Blanch the vegetables briefly. They should be tender but still have some bite. Overcooked vegetables make the salad soft and heavy."
          }
        ]
